      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Honfleur) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Frédéric Bazille (Paris) &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 8</p>\\n<p>Monet invites Bazille to leave Paris and spend two weeks with him in Honfleur, comments at length on his own work, and enquires after Bazille’s.</p>",
