      "EventId": 3,
      "Title": "Claude Monet to Frédéric Bazille (3)",
      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Chailly-en-Bière) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Frédéric Bazille (Paris) &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 20</p>\\n<p>Work - Monet is working on his &quot;Déjeuner sur l&#x27;herbe&quot;. Monet asks whether his paintings were ready in time to be dispatched and whether his bills were paid. He complains to Bazille for not writing to him, as he had promised to help with Monet’s current work</p>",
