      "EventId": 5,
      "Title": "Claude Monet to Frédéric Bazille (5)",
      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Sainte-Adresse) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Frédéric Bazille (Paris) &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 33</p>\\n<p>Work - Monet is with his father and aunt in Sainte-Adresse on the Normandy coast, in excellent working conditions. Before leaving Paris he had sold a seascape and a view of Paris, which has enabled him to give some financial help to Camille Doncieux.</p>",
