      "EventId": 50,
      "Title": "Claude Monet to Gustave Geffroy (50)",
      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Gustave Geffroy</p>\\n<p>Artists - Monet urges Geffroy to read Arsène Alexandre’s latest article on Cézanne and refute it. Enraged by Alexandre’s attack on Cézanne, Monet praises his fellow artist. See letter no. 2945 (1321a, Vol. V, p. 207) sent to Geffroy on 10 Dec 1895 as a follow up to the present letter, and letter no. 2946 (1321b, Vol. V, p. 207) sent to Geffroy on 15 Dec 1895 following his correspondent’s response.</p>",
