      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Gustave Geffroy (Paris) &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 2945</p>\\n<p>Monet writes in defense of Cezanne in light of Zola&#x27;s L&#x27;Oeuvre, and suggests writing an article to &#x27;restore the facts&#x27; and praise Cezanne.</p>",
