      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Gustave Geffroy (Paris) &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 2946</p>\\n<p>Following their conversation about recent damaging discourses about Cezanne (Arsène Alexandre’s article and Zola’s L’Oeuvre, in which the protagonist, Charles Lantier, was thought to be based on Cezanne; see AH.1273 and AH.1111), Monet urges Geffroy to use his influence and refute these “false legends”.</p>",
