      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (London) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Alice Hoschedé (Giverny) &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 1599</p>\\n<p>Monet regrets the hospital in London being closed on Saturdays, the lack of mail on Sundays, and his solitude. He gives Alice instructions regarding the garden, the house employees, and Durand-Ruel’s request for a canvas.</p>",
