      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Gustave Geffroy (Paris) &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 2211</p>\\n<p>Life - Monet declines an invitation due to harsh weather and difficult travel conditions, apologizes sincerely, and promises to come when the weather improves while sending his warm regards.</p>",
