      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Isidore Montaignac &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 2215</p>\\n<p>Work - Monet has painted nothing other than the large decorations for several years and therefore has few works to offer Montaignac, but he will be delighted to receive him in Giverny and will show him what he has left.</p>",
