      "Title": "Claude Monet to André Barbier (122)",
      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> André Barbier &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 2224</p>\\n<p>Life - Monet apologizes for his delayed reply, explaining that his intense focus on work and frequent trips to Paris have kept him from writing, thanks Barbier for the photographs, and invites him to visit Giverny with Geffroy when the weather improves.</p>",
