      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Sacha Guitry &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 2225</p>\\n<p>Life - Monet regrets being unable to attend Guitry’s premiere and returns the tickets, sends affectionate regards, and expresses concern about the outcome of Guitry’s military medical review.</p>",
