      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Gustave Geffroy (Paris) &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 2226</p>\\n<p>Dealers (charity auction) - Monet says he is willing to help the blind either with money or a small work, but asks for details about the loan society and the sale process to ensure it will not disadvantage donors, and requests further information before committing.</p>",
