      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Sacha Guitry &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 2233</p>\\n<p>Work - Monet wants to take advantage of the good weather to work, which will forbid him from attenting Guitry&#x27;s premiere of &quot;Un soir quand on est seul&quot;.</p>",
