      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Georges Clemenceau</p>\\n<p>Work - Monet and Clemenceau plan to visit the bombed Reims cathedral, and Monet wishes to make a quick visit to his son but wants to be back at work on Monday.</p>",
