      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Bernheim-Jeune (Paris)</p>\\n<p>Work - Monet apologizes for breaking his promise to visit, explaining that poor weather has severely disrupted his work and that he must continue painting despite exhaustion, while sending warm regards.</p>",
