      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> André Barbier &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 2240</p>\\n<p>Work - Monet  says he is exhausted from painting, he is going to rest by the sea, and postpones Barbier&#x27;s visit until later.</p>",
