      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Bernheim-Jeune (Paris)</p>\\n<p>Dealers - Monet thanks Bernheim-Jeune for some reels (bobines) they sent for his son Michel, and tries to make plans to meet. The artist is expecting word from Bernheim-Jeune on when some pastels he discussed in letter no. 2253 (Vol. IV, 26 Nov 1917, p. 398) will be ready.</p>",
