      "EventId": 212,
      "Title": "Claude Monet to Mme. Barillon (212)",
      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Mme. Barillon (Paris) &middot; <strong>W. ID:</strong> 2259</p>\\n<p>Work - Monet urgently requests a dozen high-quality flat brushes and the dimensions of two reserved canvases from his art supplier, Madame Barillon, enclosing a hand-drawn sketch of a brush head to specify his needs.</p>",
