      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Gaston Bernheim-Jeune (Bernheim de Villers), Josse Bernheim-Jeune</p>\\n<p>Dealers, life - Monet confirms the Bernheim brothers&#x27; planned visit to Giverny and suggests practical travel arrangements. If they cannot come by car, he offers to have them collected by automobile from the station at Mantes using his travel permit.</p>",
