      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Gustave Geffroy (Paris)</p>\\n<p>Life - Monet writes to express concern for Geffroy during the war, shares news of his family, and conveys his admiration and worry for Clemenceau.</p>",
