      "Body": "<p><strong>From:</strong> Claude Monet (Giverny) &middot; <strong>To:</strong> Arsène Alexandre</p>\\n<p>Monet writes to Arsène Alexandre overwhelmed by the constant demands surrounding the donation of the Nymphéas and the planned monograph. He confides that he feels utterly discouraged and disillusioned, even regretting the idea of the donation and the book.</p>",
